message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "AFOS — Brazil 2026 Electoral Divergence Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Open, auditable dataset cross-referencing prediction markets (Polymarket),
  TSE-registered electoral polls, and press coverage for Brazil's 2026
  presidential cycle, with explicit market-versus-poll divergence rather than
  smoothed averages. Includes the official TSE poll registry, published national
  poll results, a daily Polymarket odds time-series, and a reconstructed
  divergence time-series.
